The purpose of this web application is to provide travelers with quick and easy access to the most popular tourist attractions in different cities. Instead of searching across multiple sources, users can simply select a city and instantly view a curated list of top destinations with short descriptions. This helps tourists save time in planning, discover iconic landmarks, and get a clear idea of what each place offers. The app is designed to be simple, user-friendly, and informative, making it a handy digital companion for anyone exploring new cities.
